# Tauri requires the `icons/` directory but the binary placeholder PNG/ICO/ICNS
# files are non-text and cannot live in this repo without being checked in as
# binary blobs. Run the following on your dev machine after cloning to
# generate a default icon set:
#
#     cd client
#     pnpm tauri icon path/to/source-1024.png
#
# Until then, `pnpm tauri dev` will work (icons are only required at bundle
# time), but `pnpm tauri build` will fail on the missing icon files.
#
# This file exists solely to keep the `icons/` directory tracked by git.
